From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Almeida Barrios <gabarrios2006@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:34:16 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] send: leave the <biz> node to whatsmeow

GenerateWABinary added a <biz> node for buttons, lists and native flow
messages, and WinZapp's whatsmeow adds the one WhatsApp Web sends: two
<biz> nodes, refused by the server with 479 (smax-invalid). Only the opt-in
<bot biz_bot="1"/> stays.
---
 goneonize/main.go          | 146 ++-----------------------------------
 goneonize/wabinary_test.go |  39 ++++++++++
 2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 139 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 goneonize/wabinary_test.go

